I understand how it can feel disappointing when one experiences boredom. There are many different ways to combat this feeling and keep yourself entertained. For instance, you could consider:

- Going for a walk or engaging in some physical activity;
- Listening to music, a podcast, or audiobook;
- Reading a captivating novel;
- Trying out a new hobby;
- Engaging in creative arts;
- Playing games or doing a puzzle;
- Planning and setting up an enjoyable game night with friends.

There are countless possibilities, and hopefully, one of them will pique your interest and get you excited again!

